<title>USA: Belden Wire to supply CBS television network.</title>
<headline>Belden Wire to supply CBS television network.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Ind. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belden Wire &amp; Cable said Wednesday it has been selected by CBS Inc to be its exclusive supplier of wire and cable products for various CBS operations.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The supply agreement includes all CBS radio and television stations, CBS News and CBS Operations, Belden said. Audio, video, data and multimedia cables are expected to be included in the deal.</p>
<p>Belden Wire &amp; Cable is a unit of Belden Inc. The CBS television network is owned by Westinghouse Electric Corp .</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
